<goodsDescription><![CDATA[<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<title>DJI Mic Mini 2 콤보 무선 마이크 (2TX+1RX+충전케이스) | 드론박스 공식</title>\r\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"드론박스 공식 DJI Mic Mini 2 콤보 — 10g 초경량·48시간 배터리·2단계 노이즈 캔슬링. 유튜버, 크리에이터, 기업 인터뷰 모두 지원. 정품 보증, 당일 출고.\">\r\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"DJI Mic Mini 2, 무선마이크, 유튜브마이크, 방송용마이크, 핀마이크, 브이로그마이크, 인터뷰마이크, 드론박스, DJI공식, 무선핀마이크, 카메라마이크, 인터뷰마이크추천, 유튜브장비, DJI미니마이크, DJI MIC MINI, DJI믹미니, MIC MINI2\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"DJI Mic Mini 2 콤보 무선 마이크 | 드론박스 공식\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"10g으로 스튜디오급 사운드를. DJI Mic Mini 2 콤보 — 드론박스에서 정품으로.\">\r\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"product\">\r\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\r\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700;900&amp;family=Outfit:wght@400;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\n:root{\r\n  --black:#111111;--white:#ffffff;\r\n  --gray-50:#f7f8fa;--gray-100:#eef0f3;--gray-200:#dde0e7;\r\n  --gray-400:#9aa0ad;--gray-600:#5a6270;--gray-800:#2c3040;\r\n  --accent:#0095da;--accent-2:#00c6ff;--accent-light:#e6f5ff;\r\n  --navy:#0d2240;\r\n}\r\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}\r\nbody{font-family:\'Noto Sans KR\',sans-serif;color:var(--black);background:#fff;overflow-x:hidden;}\r\nimg{max-width:100%;display:block;}\r\n.section{width:100%;}\r\n\r\n/* HERO */\r\n.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf6ff 0%,#f0faff 40%,#fafcff 100%);padding:52px 24px 48px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-100);}\r\n.hero::after{content:\'\';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-60px;width:320px;height:320px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,149,218,.12) 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;}\r\n.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 14px;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;}\r\n.hero-eyebrow{font-family:\'Outfit\',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;}\r\n.hero h1{font-family:\'Outfit\',sans-serif;font-size:38px;font-weight:800;color:var(--black);line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em;}\r\n.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);}\r\n.hero-sub{font-size:15px;color:var(--gray-600);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;}\r\n.hero-img-wrap{width:100%;max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 36px;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,100,180,.10);}\r\n.hero-img-wrap img{width:100%;}\r\n.hero-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}\r\n.chip{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--gray-200);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray-800);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}\r\n.chip strong{color:var(--accent);}\r\n\r\n/* SECTION HEADER */\r\n.sh{text-align:center;padding:52px 24px 0;}\r\n.sh-label{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-light);color:var(--accent);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:20px;padding:4px 14px;margin-bottom:12px;}\r\n.sh h2{font-family:\'Outfit\',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:var(--black);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:8px;}\r\n.sh h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);}\r\n.sh p{font-size:14px;color:var(--gray-600);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px;}\r\n\r\n/* 6가지 이유 */\r\n.reasons-wrap{padding:0 16px 52px;}\r\n.reasons-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;}\r\n.r-card{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--gray-100);border-radius:18px;padding:22px 16px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.04);}\r\n.r-card.full{grid-column:1/-1;}\r\n.r-icon{font-s